WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:08.390
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:14.890
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.730
It's my day!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:27.310
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:34.710
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:42.090
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:49.490
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:55.270
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:02.410
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:09.910
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:16.050
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.120
I just want to walk

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.660
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.630
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:35.540
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:41.980
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:44.250
It's my day!

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:52.420
Uh... the jeans party...

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:55.120
Oh, come on... It was a joke!

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.090
Who would have a jeans party

00:01:57.160 --> 00:02:00.390
at an elite club in the middle
of Roppongi?

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:02.260
<i>They tricked me!</i>

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:11.870
"I Won't Be Hurt!"

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:20.950
I'm leaving.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.620
Maybe this kind of environment...

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:26.490
is too much for Makino.

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:29.920
I mean, look...

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:33.430
The heirs of political dynasties
are here too.

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:34.790
Isn't it fun?

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:38.030
You get to meet people
you'd never meet otherwise.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:39.470
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.670
<i>What's so fun about this?</i>

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:43.940
And there's so much
haute cuisine...

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:46.410
Like fois gras, caviar...

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.110
Bet you've never had these.

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:49.440
Say...

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:52.040
Don't force her to eat things
she's not used to.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.980
You don't want her to
end up with a stomach-ache.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.520
I guess you're right.

00:02:58.550 --> 00:02:59.720
I agree.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:14.000
<i>Girls' bullying can get out of hand.</i>

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.170
Hello, ladies.

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.440
Hello!

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:25.040
What college are you from?

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.450
Oh... we're from Eitoku's high school.

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:32.050
Really? Well, you look
so pretty and mature,

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.750
I thought you were college students.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:36.720
Oh... you're good!

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:42.190
You're very unique.

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:43.830
Wild and individualistic.

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.400
Are you from Eitoku, too?

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:46.360
Yeah.

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:51.540
Hmm... I thought that girls
from Eitoku were all alike.

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:53.370
I guess there are exceptional girls
like you, huh?

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.070
So what's your name?

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:57.910
Of course, she's different.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.980
She ran with delinquents in junior high!

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:04.510
Delinquents?

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.520
She slept around with
quite a few fellows, too.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:13.460
S-shall we go?

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:14.760
Yeah.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.500
That blackboard!

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:24.030
Yes.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.740
We wrote it.

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.500
W-why?!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.610
We spend an enormous amount
of time and money

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:35.810
in order to become perfect women...

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:38.410
to marry perfect men someday.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.920
Men like the ones from the F4.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.820
We can't stand having them stolen
away from us...

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.720
by weeds like you!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.260
And by the way...

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.270
You seem to like Hanazawa.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:01.040
It's no use, because he's had his eyes
on someone else for ages!

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:04.740
Why would he waste time
on an average girl like you?

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:10.710
What happened?

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.520
<i>No way will I let them
get the better of me!</i>

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:25.130
I believe you fully understand
your position now.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.100
Fools! You've got it all wrong!

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.330
You parasites of men!

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:32.330
Parasites?!

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.900
If you want the guys from the F4,
why don't you go after them?

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.340
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.610
Let me call your attention to
this gadget in my hand.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.810
This amazing tool searches out
one's true feelings.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.880
You're here to hook
some good-looking guy.

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:49.220
Huh?! W-what?!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.390
H-hey! Stop!

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:56.860
You're just looking for
the opportunity

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:57.890
to snare a rich boy!

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:58.890
T-that's...!

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:07.570
And all these glittery, fancy accessories
are seduction gear.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:08.530
N-no!

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:20.310
You are so wrong if you
think this is over!

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:23.850
Interesting... if you want to take
me on, just try it.

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:25.750
I may be just a weed,

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:28.190
but I'm immune to every
kind of herbicide!

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:39.230
W-what?!

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:41.330
How terrible!

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:44.700
She's something else!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:53.480
<i>Hanazawa's had his eyes
on someone else for ages!</i>

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:56.950
<i>Why would he waste time
on an average girl like you?</i>

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:58.180
No!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.390
<i>I'm not in love.</i>

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:08.730
<i>I'm not hurt.
My heart doesn't ache.</i>

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:12.360
<i>Yet...</i>

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:14.630
<i>Why does my heart feel so heavy?</i>

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.440
I'm done.

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:25.540
Unusual for Sis to
leave her breakfast unfinished.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.080
I know...
I wonder if she's feeling sick.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:34.520
<i>I'm not in love...</i>

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.490
Excuse me...

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:43.430
Did you eat a proper breakfast?

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:44.230
Huh?

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.760
Life without love
isn't worth living.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.140
The new health teacher...

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:58.910
<i>The other teacher got harassed
by the F4 and quit.</i>

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.350
<i>No way will I fall in love
with someone from the F4!</i>

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:09.850
There's no way...

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:23.300
<i>I have to do something
about this depression.</i>

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.000
<i>I can't take this.</i>

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.040
Yo.

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:39.150
<i>Maybe I'll come to see you
in the emergency stairway.</i>

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:41.380
<i>Then I won't go there again.</i>

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.490
<i>No! Why's he here?</i>

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.850
Don't just stand there. Sit.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.760
You said you wouldn't
come here anymore.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:53.330
Got a problem?

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.700
No, I don't...

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:57.130
I like it here.

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:00.430
You can't hear the noisy
fighting in the halls.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.340
<i>I've never seen
Rui Hanazawa like this.</i>

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.770
Oh yeah...

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:13.610
Do you know the time difference
between Japan and France?

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:17.380
Huh? France?
Where did that come from?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.190
If you don't know, never mind.

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:26.190
<i>I feel so restless... how weird.</i>

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:29.760
<i>But I'm a teeny bit happy.</i>

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:41.810
See ya!

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:42.670
Bye-bye!

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:46.780
Makino... we saw you.

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:52.650
We didn't know you've been meeting
Hanazawa over there.

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:59.560
How dare you humiliate us yesterday.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:01.760
Come with us.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.700
You seem to be more dense
than we thought.

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.330
So we're going to make you
understand.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:14.770
What do you want, bringing me
all the way out here?

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:18.680
We'll see if you're just as
cocky after this.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:24.280
<i>"YY"? It's the ultimate magazine for
young ladies.</i>

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.580
<i>Why show it to me?</i>

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:31.190
"The first Japanese woman to become
Miss Teen of France. "

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.390
"Shizuka Todo, age 19."

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.700
"On sabbatical from Eitoku College..."

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:41.060
"and currently attending
 Sorbonne University."

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.600
"Father is the president
of Todo Trading."

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:52.780
This girl... has such an
amazing background...

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:55.680
She's the girl Rui's been in
love with for so long.

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:59.320
She'll soon finish up her studies in France and come home.

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:02.750
<i>Do you know the time difference
between Japan and France?</i>

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:05.520
Well, what do you think?

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:07.990
Do you have a chance
against <i>her</i>?

00:11:08.360 --> 00:11:11.760
What's the matter?
Lost your spirit?

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:14.800
What happened to
yesterday's spunk?

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:18.530
<i>I have to say something!</i>

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:20.870
Understand?

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:24.210
Flirt all you want,
but you won't win over the F4.

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:26.740
<i>But... I can't find any words.</i>

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.410
We're in a different rank
from you.

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:32.610
If you understand, hurry and
leave this school!

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:18.490
<i>Why? Why is it such a shock?</i>

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:22.900
<i>Love? I'm not in love.</i>

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:25.330
Serves her right!

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:26.670
Hey you.

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:30.970
Who gave you permission to
bring her here?

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:32.370
Domyoji!

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:36.640
The only one allowed to
bully her... is me!

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:41.610
You'll find red slips on your
lockers tomorrow!

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:42.850
No!

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:48.020
You all right?

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:57.930
Don't cry. It's not like you.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:00.900
Can you stand up?

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:01.930
Here.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:19.520
Oh... You've gotta be kidding!

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:23.620
What's the big idea?!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:26.660
Whose fault is it
that I'm being treated like this?!

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:28.090
You moron!

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:30.460
What's with that attitude?!

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:32.830
I came here just to save you!

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:34.900
I never asked you to!

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:40.770
N-no one in the whole school
dares to talk back to me...

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:43.070
That's because they're
all cowards!

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.410
Just what is it you don't
like about me?!

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:47.510
Tell me!

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:50.380
Is there someone in this world
more perfect than I am?

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:52.250
I hate you 'cuz you're stupid.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.750
I hate your ugly hair style.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.790
I hate your cocky swagger!

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:59.090
I hate you because you're so conceited!

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.190
And I hate your sneaky snake eyes!

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:03.190
W-wha...?

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:04.930
I hate everything about you!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:14.600
Damn... I'll get you for this!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:21.710
<i>Boy, what a shock!
What's with him?</i>

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:23.750
<i>And those eyes...</i>

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:26.980
<i>Doesn't he realize
he's the cause of this?!</i>

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.050
<i>It was so unexpected...</i>

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:31.820
<i>that I let him see me cry.</i>

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:35.990
Is it true that Shizuka is
returning from France?

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:37.190
Looks like it.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.000
<i>Akira Mimasaka and
Sojiro Nishikado.</i>

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.530
Hey! Working virgin!

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.770
P-please stop calling me that!

00:14:46.470 --> 00:14:48.900
Come over here and have a drink.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:53.040
Alcohol?! Should a high 
school student be drinking?

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:54.340
Stupid!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.010
It's tea. Plain old tea.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:59.010
It's no fun with just Akira.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.680
Better you than no girls at all.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.090
<i>This is so weird.</i>

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:06.520
I see...

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:09.390
Shizuka must've gotten
so pretty.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:12.090
Yeah... my mom mentioned that
Shizuka's the campaign girl...

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:15.500
for All-Japan Airlines'
Tahiti promotion...

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:17.900
They're putting posters 
of her up all over town.

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:22.000
So that's why Rui's been acting
strange lately.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:26.910
Um... What's the relationship between
Hanazawa and this Shizuka?

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:31.310
Shizuka is Rui's first love.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:34.480
That was back when he
started elementary school.

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:37.980
Rui's father is super strict.

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:42.120
Yup... even we were scared to
go to his house.

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:48.460
Being the only son, Rui was
brought up strictly.

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:50.930
Maybe that's how he
became introverted.

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:55.330
He was very sensitive and didn't allow
anyone to get close to him.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.900
He's like that even now sometimes.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:01.210
When we all played, he'd
sit alone in the corner.

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:02.440
Wouldn't even laugh.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.880
How can I put it...
his eyes were dead.

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:09.450
He'd look fine, then
suddenly start vomiting.

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:12.420
As kids, we didn't
know what to make of him.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.090
Around that time, Shizuka,
who was two years older, came and...

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:17.960
<i>Rui, let's play.</i>

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.730
<i>I'll take you to my special,
secret place.</i>

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:22.330
<i>It's really wonderful.</i>

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.760
<i>There are squirrels,
here in Tokyo!</i>

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.630
Little by little, she drew Rui out.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.770
<i>Look, see?</i>

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:33.000
Shizuka is an amazing girl.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:36.210
Rui was so bad off, they thought 
he might need a psychiatrist...

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:37.810
Yet Shizuka was able to
make him smile!

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:47.450
<i>My head is pounding!</i>

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:50.420
<i>Like I was hit on the head
with a hammer!</i>

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:54.730
Anyway, it was all one-sided
on Rui's part... and never declared.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:57.460
Who knows what'll happen
when they meet up again?

00:16:57.590 --> 00:17:00.700
Yeah... Goes to show, you gotta love
older women.

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:03.030
You're missing the point, Akira.

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.810
<i>What's wrong with me?</i>

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:16.450
<i>My legs feel so weak.</i>

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:20.320
<i>I'm not in love!</i>

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:22.790
Hey, that boy's kind of cute.

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:25.890
Yuck! Look!
He's kissing the poster!

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.380
You again?

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:58.790
T-that's my line!

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:03.760
You'll catch a disease,
kissing something like that!

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:06.530
How silly to get so delirious...

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:09.630
Just because your first love
is coming home.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.400
<i>Oh no! I can't stop shaking!</i>

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:18.810
Say... do you like me?

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.350
Who'd like you?!

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:49.570
You were wishing for that, weren't you?

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.110
Are you...

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:58.950
...really Rui Hanazawa?

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:02.750
You're cute... when you look surprised.

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:06.350
<i>He's playing with me!
How infuriating!</i>

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:08.620
<i>You dysfunctional delinquent!</i>

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:14.090
<i>I don't even want to think...
that I might like him!</i>

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:15.830
<i>But...</i>

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:18.200
<i>I was drowning in those eyes...</i>

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:20.930
<i>I couldn't move.</i>

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.100
<i>Yet...</i>

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:37.180
Look! Shizuka is in an ad!

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:38.380
How beautiful!

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:40.820
I wish I could be like her!

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:44.760
So different from a
weed we know.

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:47.360
Such a pretty dress!

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:49.030
Such a nice day!

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:52.600
<i>I know that better than
anyone else!</i>

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:56.170
<i>Huh? That's...</i>

00:19:58.370 --> 00:19:59.900
D-Domyoji!

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:01.240
Yo!

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:04.980
What'd you do?!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:06.380
Just get this straight!

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:08.350
I didn't do it because
of what you said!

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.450
I just thought it was time
for a change.

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:13.020
Don't take it wrong!

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:16.490
Wow... looks pretty good!

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:19.190
R-really? Guess so...

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:23.760
It took five hours to
straighten my hair...

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:33.070
Damn that crooked hairstylist!

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:34.640
He'll pay for this!

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:37.470
Hey, stop laughing!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:38.770
Tsukasa!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.340
Here you are!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.980
Shizuka is back.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:45.380
<i>Shizuka Todo...</i>

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:50.950
Shizuka...

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:54.860
<i>She's back from France.</i>

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:56.660
Rui...

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:16.880
I missed you so much!

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:11.630
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:19.510
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:29.380
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:37.420
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.420 --> 00:22:45.200
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:53.340
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:53.340
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.340 --> 00:23:01.710
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.340 --> 00:23:01.710
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:11.490
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:19.260
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.530 --> 00:23:27.440
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.530 --> 00:23:27.440
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:35.850
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:35.850
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:49.660
<i>Domyoji, what're you doing?!</i>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.800
<i>I never considered you to be
a decent human being!</i>

00:23:53.060 --> 00:23:56.370
<i>How dare you red tag
my dear friend!</i>

00:23:57.170 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>Kazuya, run!</i>

00:23:59.440 --> 00:24:01.000
<i>Hurry and run!</i>

00:24:02.200 --> 00:24:04.670
<i>Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"The Ordinary Duo!"</i>

00:24:05.470 --> 00:24:07.280
<i>Someone, help us!</i>
